Beyond Kyushu.

718
01:04:13,378 --> 01:04:15,908
九州から先。でも結構、広めの道が
Beyond Kyushu. But quite wide roads

719
01:04:17,498 --> 01:04:18,698
ありそう。
might be there.

720
01:04:18,868 --> 01:04:22,618
