There's an elementary school on this side... Shimamatsu-cho, that's right.

856
01:14:33,975 --> 01:14:36,535
[Sign: 島松小 130周年 2022.07.20 / 柏木川 KGP]
[Sign: Shimamatsu Elementary 130th Anniversary 2022.07.20 / Kashiwagi River KGP]

857
01:14:36,565 --> 01:14:42,245
島松小がこちらにございますのじゃ。島松小を発見。
Shimamatsu Elementary is right here. Found Shimamatsu Elementary.

858
01:14:42,765 --> 01:14:46,615
で、今いるのが、ここかな？ ここに来ていって、
